---
# AI Network Configuration
## Configures the dedicated network for AI services via a systemd-network drop-in.
## This provides an isolated subnet to facilitate secure and predictable
## communication between AI-related containers.

variant: fcos
version: 1.6.0

storage:
  files:
    - path: /etc/containers/systemd/ai.network
      overwrite: true
      contents:
        inline: |
          [Network]
          NetworkName=%p
          Subnet=172.16.200.0/24
      user:
        name: root
      group:
        name: root
      mode: 0644
